OL,3,GNEWSAHorniman Museum's new gallery to
OL,4,Aopen in February
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Horniman Museum is set to open its
OL,7,Fnew Nature Gallery in February 2027.
OL,9,FThe south-east London museum said the
OL,10,Ffully refurbished space, previously
OL,11,Fnamed the Natural History Gallery, had
OL,12,Fbeen reimagined to celebrate the
OL,13,Fvariety of life on earth and explore
OL,14,Fhumankind's place within, and impact
OL,15,Fon, nature.
OL,17,FThe opening is the final part of the
OL,18,Fmuseum's #12.5m Nature + Love
OL,19,Ftransformation project, supported by
OL,20,FThe National Lottery Heritage Fund.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
