OL,3,GNEWSAHorniman Museum's new gallery to
OL,4,Aopen in February
OL,5,
OL,6,FMichael Salter-Church MBE, chairman of
OL,7,Fthe museum, said: "Opening these
OL,8,Fwonderful new spaces marks the end of
OL,9,Fthe Horniman's extraordinary 125th
OL,10,Fanniversary year."
